  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana Transport Sector Improvement Project Additional Financing MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to provide additional
 financing to the Ghana Transport Sector Improvement Project (Cr.6081-GH), which has its objective to: (i) reduce travel time on selected parts of the classified road network in Northern Ghana; (ii) promote road safety; and (iii) strengthen the institutional management of the transport sector.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
